      "lines": [
        "由命题$A(k)$（$2^k>k^2$）推出命题$A(k+1)$（$2^{k+1}>(k+1)^2$）. 因",
        "为$k\\geqslant5$，所以$k>1$，$k-2>1$. 后两个不等式的两边分别相",
        "乘，得到"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$k(k-2)>1$，$k^2-2k>1$，$k^2>2k+1$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "因此"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "$2^{k+1}=2\\times2^k>2k^2=k^2+k^2>k^2+2k+1=(k+1)^2$，"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "p",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "于是，$2^{k+1}>(k+1)^2$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "exhead",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "习 题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "10",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "10. 利用数学归纳法证明下列不等式成立：",
        "а) $2^n>n$，当$n\\geqslant0$（$n\\in Z$）；",
        "б) $2^n>2n+1$，当$n\\geqslant3$（$n\\in Z$）."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "11",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "11. 证明当$n\\geqslant2$时，以下不等式成立：",
        "$|a_1+a_2+\\cdots+a_n|\\leqslant|a_1|+|a_2|+\\cdots+|a_n|$."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "h3",
      "label": null,
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "第一章 补充习题"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "12",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "12. 证明：对于任意数值$x$，不等式$x+|x|\\geqslant0$成立. 说明",
        "在证明的哪一部分用到完全归纳法."
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "13",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "13. 证明：对于$x\\in Z$和$y\\in Z$，表达式$x^2+y^2$的值除以$4$后，",
        "不可能余$3$.",
        "（提示：分析$x$和$y$的值都是偶数、都是奇数、一偶一奇",
        "的情况.）"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ex",
      "label": "14",
      "box": null,
      "owner_exercise": null,
      "cont": false,
      "open": false,
      "samerow": false,
      "lines": [
        "14. 证明：如果$a$和$b$都不是$3$的倍数，那么它们的平方和",
        "$a^2+b^2$除以$3$余$2$."
      ]
    },
